<p>Published estimates put Lopez at around <strong>$14m</strong>, a figure that sits a long way below <strong>$239.02m</strong> in career earnings. Nothing published appears to have been updated in years.</p>
<p><a href="/teams/brooklyn-nets/">New Jersey</a> took him tenth in 2008 out of Stanford. His twin brother Robin was drafted five picks ahead of him in the same round, and the two played eighteen seasons in the league between them.</p>

</div>
